{"kind": "mod", "id": 1136, "name": "Equip From Weapon Rack", "slug": "equip-from-weapon-rack", "teaser": "Allow equipping weapons directly from your weapon rack", "owner_name": "DrakiaXYZ", "downloads": 33770, "favourites": 42, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "xyz.drakia.equipfromweaponrack", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Other", "category_id": 17, "updated_at": "2026-08-03T06:02:26.000000Z", "created_at": "2023-10-28T17:54:07.000000Z", "published_at": "2023-10-28T17:54:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~4.1.0", "latest_version": "1.6.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Tired of having to load your hideout just to get access to one of your guns that you’ve put on display?</p>\n<p>No more! Now you can use the quick equip selector to pick guns from your weapon rack alongside those in your stash!</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/YbD8mae.png\" alt=\"YbD8mae.png\" /></p>\n<h3>Installation</h3>\n<p>1) Open the downloaded zip file in 7-zip</p>\n<p>2) Select the folder in the zip file in 7-zip</p>\n<p>3) Drag the selected folder from 7-zip into your SPT folder</p>\n<p>Demonstration Video (Yes, it’s Quest Tracker, but the same concept applies to all of my mods, I’m not making mod-specific extraction example videos):</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/afNPjAw.gif\" alt=\"Install Gif\" /></p>\n<h3>Configuration</h3>\n<p>That’s the neat part, there isn’t any. The plugin is drag and drop, and starts working the next time you load the game. Zero configuration, zero fuss.</p>\n<p>If you enjoy my work, you can <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/drakiaxyz\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">feed my caffeine addiction</a></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_versi